currently displayed code; if that code is about to expire, wait for it to rotate and read the new one. Then switch back to Default Browser and go to github.com/login (it is already 
open in the background). Read the UI and find where to put the OTP code. Clear the OTP field completely, then fill in the exact OTP code you just read, with no spaces. Then press the 
